Hi,
 
The September meeting of the PWG and IEEE P2600 in Montreal
has been moved back to the original week of September 10th.
 
Linux Foundation Open Printing team plans to co-locate Printing
Summit 2007 in Montreal in September.
 
Till and I would like to find a university site or a host company,
because no local host company has yet volunteered.
 
We'll keep you posted - and we'll cross-post to Printing Sumit list
_after_ we get more planning details (meeting site, recommended
hotel, etc.).
 
Cheers,
- Ira
 
 

