Subject: FYI - September PWG Calendar change back to September 10



For those planning long range calendars, be advised the PWG Steering
Committee is proposing an adjustment to the September meeting moving it from
week of Sept 17 back to it's original slot week of September 10. This is due
to revaluation of several conflicts. In the absence of any strong objection,
we intend this decision to become final during the SC conference call this
Thursday. 
